      'vernal','vibrant','vivid','votive','wardened','waxen','weathered','weeping','wildborn','windcut','withered','woven',
      'yearless','leafy','blooming','budding','fruiting','climbing','creeping','trailing','arching','nodding','clasping','channeled',
      'pinnate','palmate','banded','blighted','braided','corded','crusted','dappled','drifted','flooded','fluted','gilded',
      'jagged','jointed','knotted','lidded','lustred','mantled','marbled','matted','moated','mottled','mounded','muted',
